// Soundboard v13 — Sound Forge pack: 87 studio WAV files in public/sounds/
// (generated by new soundboard/sound_forge.py, manifest.json beside them).
// Each button shows a custom Hush emoji from public/emoji/ (never Unicode).
// Custom sounds: uploaded per-room/server files, plus the user's permanent
// personal board stored on-device in IndexedDB (see soundboard-store.js) —
// those only reach the server when the user explicitly shares them, so the
// server disk stays small.
// Playing any sound relays it via Socket.IO `soundboard:play` /
// `server:soundboard:play` (server validates built-in ids + custom lists).

